<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> KCl                                                    </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;31.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> ZnCl<sub>2</sub>                                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MnSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;<I>x</I>H<sub>2</sub>O                           </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>B<sub>4</sub>O<sub>7</sub>&#183;10H<sub>2</sub>O                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Glycine                                                 </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>CO<sub>3</sub>                                          </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;230.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.5&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Resazurin                                               </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> mg  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components except yeast extract,  bovine serum albumin and Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O.  Bring to a boil for 5-10 sec and flush  with N<sub>2</sub>.  Adjust pH to 7.6 at 80-90C.  After cooling to room temperature, dispense the medium into serum bottles under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere,  seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave.  Separately autoclave yeast extract as a 10% solution and neutralized Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O as a 5%  solution under a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere. Filter-sterilize bovine serum albumin as a 10% (w/v) solution under  a N<sub>2</sub> atmosphere.  Before inoculation,  aseptically and anaerobically add the yeast extract, bovine serum albumin and neutralized Na<sub>2</sub>S&#183;9H<sub>2</sub>O solutions.       <br>
